# Optional. Leave unset: the UI calls `/api/...` on its own origin.
#   - Production: the Spring Boot jar serves the UI and the API from one origin.
#   - Development: `npm run dev` (http://localhost:5173) proxies `/api` to http://localhost:8080
#     (see vite.config.ts), so the sign-in cookie and CSRF token stay same-origin.
# Set this only if the API is reachable under a different public address *through the same
# origin* (for example a reverse proxy). A genuinely cross-origin value cannot carry the session
# cookie, so sign-in would not work.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
